===Verb===
{{en-verb|swatt}}

# {{label|en|transitive}} To [[beat]] [[off]], as insects; to [[bat]], [[strike]], or [[hit]].
#: ''He '''swatted''' the mosquito that was buzzing around in his bedroom.''
#: ''The cat '''swatted''' at the feather.''
# {{label|en|slang|crime}} to illegitimately elicit a [[SWAT]] assault

